WEBVTT

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.520
Black Mist

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:48.020
<i>After our class came back from the trip,</i>

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:52.900
<i>things took a slightly strange turn
in our classroom.</i>

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:57.780
Huh?

00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:59.660
I don't have a single piece of chalk.

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:02.910
There were several pieces just this morning...

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:09.790
Fujiwara-no-Teika
Traces of Beauty
Graceful

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:21.180
Hey! Who threw that eraser?!

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:24.970
Well?

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:27.100
LANGUAGE PREP ROOM

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.770
It's gone... It's gone...

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:34.530
It's gone.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:35.780
It's not here.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:39.030
LANGUAGE PREP ROOM

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:37.320
Excuse me.

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:39.030
I'm here to prep the classroom.

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:41.950
What's wrong?

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.490
Oh. You're on duty today?

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:46.500
I'm missing my timeline.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:50.750
Timeline? Is it that scroll you always use?

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.210
The green one.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:53.590
Yes.

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:59.090
That's right. What should I do?
It'll be troublesome if I don't have it.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.720
What's been going on recently?

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.850
These incidents keep happening...

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:09.520
<i>Is it just my imagination?
She looks like she's lost a lot of weight.</i>

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:14.980
I'll just have to do without it.
Oh, the bell's about to ring.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.280
Scroll, scroll...

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.860
Where could that long thing have gone?

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:23.950
It would stand out if it had fallen on the floor.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.370
I've got it!

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:25.700
PING

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:28.410
Teacher, I might know where it is!

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:31.040
- Huh? Ms. Kawamoto!
- I'll be right back!

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:31.040
WHIZ

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:37.920
<i>That's right. Now, even the black mood</i>

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:44.600
<i>that was taking hold of the class
had tried to engulf the teacher.</i>

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:54.520
Teacher!

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.780
Oh, thank goodness. Where was it?

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:02.570
It was mixed in with the historical timelines
in the social studies room.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:06.450
You found it for me. Thank you, Ms. Kawamoto.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:07.950
I'm impressed you figured it out.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:11.670
Oh, I thought they all had the same shape, so...

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.420
Brown-noser.

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:18.550
That's what she says,
but Kawamoto is probably the one who hid it.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.310
<i>That was Ms. Takagi's voice.</i>

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:37.070
Would you stop muttering insults about me
that are just loud enough for me to hear?

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:38.570
Ms. Takagi.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:41.820
Huh?

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:43.150
Excuse me?

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.620
Did I say something?

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.370
Don't, Ms. Kawamoto!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.890
Did you think I was going to hit you?

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.560
Of course I wouldn't do that.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:19.570
Because that would be playing
right into your hands.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:22.820
Answer me.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.570
What do you mean, I hid it?

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:27.990
Please, Ms. Kawamoto...

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:29.580
Why did you say that?

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.040
Ms. Kawamoto, stop it!

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:39.790
Teacher, you heard what she said, didn't you?

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:45.720
Why are you stopping me?

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:49.600
Do you think I'm the one who hid it?

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:50.930
Stop it, already!

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:53.020
Do not raise your voice!

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:57.440
What should I do?

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.230
Even I can imagine what happened.

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:04.940
I'm sure Ms. Takagi and her friends hid it
and then blamed Ms. Kawamoto, right?

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:07.570
But so what?!

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:09.030
There's no proof.

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:11.370
So how am I supposed to prove it?!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:15.460
I've had enough. I can't take it anymore.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.250
Don't get me involved.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.460
Every year, every single year...

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:25.010
The students change, but every time,
there's someone who gets left out and bullied.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.390
And I'm just sick of it.

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:32.060
How can you have so much free time
to be harassing your classmates?

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:33.140
Are you stupid?

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.980
Tell me, Ms. Takagi, how is it
that you have that much free time?

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:45.190
Stop torturing your classmates
and study more!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.990
In the first place,
who do you think you are?

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.250
Involving everyone else in your nonsense...

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:58.790
Think about how you're disrupting the class.
Everyone's studying for entrance exams!

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:00.130
Do you understand?

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:09.220
<i>As if a dam had burst, Teacher kept talking.
But her words became less articulate.</i>

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.470
<i>After falling silent for a while...</i>

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:26.990
<i>Her face darkened...</i>

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:29.990
<i>and she collapsed.</i>

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:36.240
<i>She never returned to school after that.</i>

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:44.500
<i>It was announced that
she had been hospitalized due to anxiety.</i>

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.720
What? So Teacher's become a shut-in?

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:59.480
Unbelievable.
What's going to happen to our class?

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:01.480
And we've got entrance exams.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.610
This is a royal pain.

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:06.480
And like, whose fault is it?

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:20.620
And so, until your new homeroom teacher
is decided, I'll be teaching this class from today.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.630
I'm Mr. Kokubu, the head teacher.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:27.880
July 10th (Thursday)
On Duty

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.420
It's almost summer vacation.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:31.720
For you third-years taking
high school entrance exams soon,

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:34.220
you understand that how
you spend this summer break

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:36.890
will result in a turning point, right?

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:44.060
It's unfortunate for you to have a change
in homeroom teachers during this period.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:46.400
Plus, I heard some of you complaining.

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:51.110
But there was bullying so bad in here
that a student transferred to another school,

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:55.820
and yet, out of 38 kids,
no one raised their voice except certain people.

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:59.490
So this is the price you're paying for ignoring it.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:07.920
That being said, before summer vacation,
I'd like to resolve this to some extent,

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:11.090
so I'll be talking to you individually.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.550
First Takagi, and then Kawamoto.

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:19.810
<i>The new homeroom teacher's clear,
reasonable manner of speaking</i>

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:24.270
<i>made the class fall silent.</i>

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:29.070
When you're called to stay after school,
report to the faculty room.

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:30.650
ATTENDANCE RECORD

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:31.940
That's all.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:41.910
<i>Then, to sort out the situation,
each of our parents were called in.</i>

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.410
<i>Parent-teacher-student conferences.</i>

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:48.960
Yeah. He asked me a lot of questions.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:56.550
It seems Teacher knew
what was going on the whole time.

00:09:57.390 --> 00:10:01.100
But she'd been a teacher for a long time,

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:04.730
and the same thing
kept happening again and again.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:07.850
And her class would be
thrown into chaos every time.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:11.730
She kept seeing situations
she couldn't do anything about,

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:16.280
until it reached the point
where she couldn't even get involved.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:24.580
Sis, what should I have done?

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:30.340
It went so far that
you have to come in to the school.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.300
I...

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:36.840
Hina, come on.

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:45.730
One cup of French toast!

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:47.730
With plenty of fresh cream!

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.310
BOOM

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:49.850
Here, hold this.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:51.020
All right, next!

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:54.190
Sir, I'll take two beef croquettes!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:57.280
One just as-is, one slathered in sauce!

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.280
Sure thing! Coming right up!

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:01.990
The depth of the water fluctuates.
Please do not step in.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.130
You sure?

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:13.130
You're always warning me
about spoiling my dinner.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:14.590
It's fine.

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:18.630
If you don't get to eat what you like at a time
like this, when will you eat it?

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:28.020
Hina, I'm going. Be it
a parent-teacher conference, or whatever,

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:30.730
I'll always be on your side.

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:36.030
Okay.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.460
Come on, let's go grocery shopping
and then go home.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.340
What do you want for dinner?

00:11:57.380 --> 00:12:00.470
Stew. Can I have it over my rice?

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:03.720
Sure. I'll put it on my rice this time too.

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:10.980
Black Mist

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:14.980
Light

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.860
CRESCENT MOON

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:18.610
I'll go.

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:21.070
No, I'm going.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:23.620
How could I not go?

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:29.700
I'm going to go and give those selfish,
rotten parents a piece of my mind!

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:32.620
You can't!

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.540
Tuesday is when you have
that important catering job, remember?

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:40.800
HISS

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.880
It's for an important tea party

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:40.800
to celebrate the 60th anniversary
of Shoueidou's founding, our valued customer!

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:41.880
SHOUEIDOU

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:44.640
Everyone is looking forward
to your sweets, Grandpa!

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:47.640
You know that better than anyone!

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:49.390
Damn it!

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:53.770
This... This is a big deal
for my granddaughter, and I...

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.020
Grandpa, it'll be okay.

00:12:56.360 --> 00:13:00.990
I'm going to have a good talk with her teacher,
so it'll be all right.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:03.490
Leave this to me!

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.820
I promise it'll be okay!

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.420
<i>Akari...</i>

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.250
<i>Akari, I'm sorry...</i>

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:24.050
I...

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:28.140
I've put you through so much...

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.560
Don't talk like that.

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:34.810
Don't worry about Hina and Momo.
They'll be okay.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:44.900
It's all right. I'll protect them
from the both of us, Mom.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.790
That dream again...

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:04.420
What should I do? I keep waking up.

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:09.470
I need to get my sleep.
The conference is tomorrow.

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:12.970
And I made a promise...

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:16.520
to Mom and Grandpa.

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:32.740
Well, goodbye.

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:40.540
Okay, Ms. Kawamoto, please come in.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.550
- Teacher!
- Mr. Kokubu!

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.300
What is it? What's wrong?

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:48.720
- Ueda was screwing around...
- and broke the window with a mop!

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:49.930
Huh? Was anyone hurt?

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:52.310
- Suzuki!
- His hand is bleeding!

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:55.310
What? What was that kid thinking?

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:59.480
Sorry, Kawamoto, can you
wait in there with your sister?

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:00.940
I'll be right back!

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.690
For crying out loud!

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:05.320
These kids are always causing trouble!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:09.070
I'm suddenly in charge of two classes
and they don't even let me catch my breath!

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:13.490
Hey, Kobayashi! Go ahead of me
and tell everyone to stay away from the glass!

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:17.910
Well, we'll be on our way.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:20.960
Okay. We'll go inside, then.

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:25.090
Oh, that's right.

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:29.840
You know, for us, the most important thing
this year are the high school entrance exams.

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:35.720
So I think it's better not to make any waves.

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:42.980
Well, going forward, if you would
advise your little sister to watch it...

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:45.780
Then for us, I wouldn't have to...

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:48.240
Well, you know...

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:55.620
What do you mean by that?

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:59.870
My daughter told me
everything I need to know.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:03.670
It seems your little sister has various issues.

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:07.210
As far as I'm concerned...

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:13.050
I don't think my sister has any issues.

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:17.350
In fact, I have no idea
what you're talking about.

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:20.020
No issues, you say?!

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:23.650
She spread rumors
about my Megumi being a thief!

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:29.400
What does she have against my daughter?!
This is so upsetting!

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:30.280
Mrs. Takagi!

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:34.030
Do you have honest conversations
with your daughter?

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:37.490
Do you properly understand
what she's thinking right now?

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:40.290
Your daughter is the one who's been a bully.

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:41.750
Shut your mouth!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:44.540
I've heard enough false accusations!
How low can you be?

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:48.300
WAAAAA

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:48.300
They're clashing?

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:50.550
This is why I scheduled them at different times!

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:50.550
RUN RUN
HUSTLE
HUSTLE

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.800
Fine, then let me ask you this.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:54.890
The proof that my daughter did it...

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:56.010
Where is it?

00:16:57.310 --> 00:16:59.310
Proof?

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:02.140
Go ahead and show it to me!

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:05.400
Otherwise, I can't put credence in it.
Isn't that right?

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:09.230
To begin with,
my daughter says she didn't do it.

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.740
I believe my daughter.

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:18.790
Proof?

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.090
Proof...

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.840
Proof of that...

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:35.590
That's right, proof.

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:37.220
Proof!

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:40.720
You don't have any?

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:47.400
No proof? Then I think we're done.

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:54.900
<i>It'll be okay, Mom. Leave it to me.</i>

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:59.580
<i>I promise to protect Hina and Momo.</i>

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:03.750
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:07.000
<i>What should I do? I promised her...</i>

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.130
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:12.550
<i>I can't...</i>

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:14.970
<i>think of what to say...</i>

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.270
Mr. Kokubu, I'm sorry!

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:30.820
My sister isn't feeling great right now,
so can we take a break?

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:54.050
You must have been so nervous.
You're as white as a sheet.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.800
Here, drink this. It'll calm you down.

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:59.260
Thank you very much.

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:01.930
Thank you...

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:08.810
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Hina.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:12.570
I couldn't respond to her...

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:15.360
I-I was pathetic.

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:23.540
After I told Grandpa and Mom
that it would be okay, to leave it to me...

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:32.590
A-After I calm down,
I-I'll go back there once more.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:37.090
I'll sit down and talk to your teacher...

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:39.090
Sis.

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:41.850
Thank you for coming.

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:44.100
Thank you for being on my side.

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:48.600
That alone makes me really happy!

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:51.770
HINATA KAWAMOTO LOVES GUYS
PERVERTED GIRL
BITCH IDIOT

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:54.020
Sis, I understand now.

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:58.740
No matter what, they would never admit it.

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:01.740
They don't even think they did anything wrong.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:07.160
And it's just like with Chiho.

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:11.670
When it's over and done with,
they'll just forget about it.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:20.380
I don't have a single reason
to waste my life on people like that.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:24.510
I swear I'll come to school to the very last day!

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:26.640
I'll endure being ignored!

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:30.850
But if they do something to me,
I'll yell at them to stop!

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:33.100
I refuse to keep my mouth shut!

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:39.490
No matter what happens here,
if I just survive and graduate, I win!

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:45.530
Honestly, I don't know
where this is coming from.

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:49.160
Calling my Megumi a bully is a false accusation
of the highest order!

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:50.910
When there isn't even any proof.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:56.880
True, there is no proof...

00:20:57.550 --> 00:21:01.050
I mean, of course there's no proof.

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:02.010
What?

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.720
Right, Ms. Takagi?

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:08.930
The person who does it will never admit it.

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:13.190
The people around the bully know that if
they snitch, they'll be the next target,

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:14.690
so they keep their mouths shut.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:19.030
There's no way proof will appear,
not with bullying.

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:22.320
It's only natural that there's no proof.

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:27.580
The only person who can say
there's been bullying is the victim.

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:34.080
So when Kawamoto said she was bullied,
that right there is the proof.

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:35.790
You have to be kidding me!

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:38.840
What if that girl is lying?

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:41.300
That's not proof!

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:43.800
She could say anything, right?

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:46.090
Then where's your proof...

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:48.600
that Kawamoto is lying?

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:53.480
Well, where's the proof?

00:21:56.560 --> 00:22:00.570
Until you show me that,
as a representative of the school,

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:03.740
I can't accept your grievance.

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:08.070
Sis, it'll be all right.

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:09.910
Thank you.

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:12.080
I'm going to hang in there.

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:15.290
Thank you, Sis.

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:20.090
Excuse me.

00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:21.380
Oh, Mr. Kokubu.

00:22:21.960 --> 00:22:24.590
Miss, how are you feeling?

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:26.680
I'm really sorry.

00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:28.800
Um, I feel better now, so—

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:30.890
No, no, stay right there.

00:22:31.890 --> 00:22:37.730
Uh, Mr. Kokubu,
I was being quite rude earlier...

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:39.650
Um...

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:45.280
Miss, you have nothing at all to be sorry about.

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:47.820
It's okay.

00:22:48.450 --> 00:22:49.780
More importantly...

00:22:50.410 --> 00:22:51.450
Well...

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:55.040
Why don't we talk about what to do next?

00:22:57.040 --> 00:23:00.040
Light

00:24:30.010 --> 00:24:32.010
Next Episode Preview

00:24:32.010 --> 00:24:37.020
Episode 35

00:24:32.470 --> 00:24:33.930
Hey, Teacher...

00:24:33.930 --> 00:24:37.020
How long are you going to
keep calling me here?

00:24:37.560 --> 00:24:40.850
You don't understand how I feel.

00:24:40.850 --> 00:24:43.360
So, tell me what's really going on.

00:24:43.650 --> 00:24:46.980
All right... I'm ready.

00:24:47.320 --> 00:24:50.030
- Hina!
- It's from Chiho!

00:24:50.030 --> 00:24:59.040
ILLUSTRATION:
HIDEAKI NISHIKAWA

00:24:50.950 --> 00:24:54.160
Don't miss the next episode of
"March Comes in Like a Lion."

00:24:54.780 --> 00:24:57.950
I'll do whatever I can for Hina.
